{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/3044bfc5d8a6bfd425fe.json":{"assets":{"mn2/gameplay_story_10616020":{"skip":{"source_cn":"见你赢得漂亮，莫勒不由得感叹年轻人的眼疾手快，还拿出礼物作为陪他玩牌的感谢。","text_i18n":{"cn":"见你赢得漂亮，莫勒不由得感叹年轻人的眼疾手快，还拿出礼物作为陪他玩牌的感谢。","en":"After your victory, Moll presents you with a gift as thanks for playing cards with him.","jp":"あなたが鮮やかに勝ったのを見て、モラーは思わず若者の素早さに感心し、対局に付き合ってくれたお礼として、プレゼントを渡してくれた。","kr":"내가 멋지게 이기자, 마울레는 젊은 사람들이 기술이 좋다고 감탄하며 같이 플레이해 준 것에 대한 고마움의 표시로 선물을 주었다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10616020"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22576"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/a75b14bad1e0ca586437.json":{"assets":{"mn2/gameplay_story_10616010":{"skip":{"source_cn":"村民莫勒正在钻研牌技，希望你能陪他玩一局。","text_i18n":{"cn":"村民莫勒正在钻研牌技，希望你能陪他玩一局。","en":"Moll has been practicing his card techniques and hopes you can play a game with him.","jp":"村人のモラーは百物集の技を磨いている最中だ。あなたに一局付き合ってほしいらしい。","kr":"마을 주민 마울레가 카드 기술을 연구하고 있다. 그가 같이 한 판 겨루자고 요청한다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10616010"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22575"]}}}},"easter_eggs/menus/10030406_1_1.cn.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_10030406:1:1","lang":"cn","texts":{"menu:41715800:1":{"text":"身为父亲，怎么能输给孩子呢？！","source_cn":"身为父亲，怎么能输给孩子呢？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民莫勒":{"text":"村民莫勒","source":"村民莫勒","status":"exact_hash"}}},"easter_eggs/menus/10030406_1_1.graph.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_10030406:1:1","roots":["menu:41715800:1"],"nodes":{"menu:41715800:1":{"id":"menu:41715800:1","type":"line","entry_kind":"say","source_node_id":"41715800:1","text_key":"menu:41715800:1","speaker_key":"speaker:村民莫勒","speaker_actor_id":"132","dialogue_frame_type":"Normal","dialogue_frame_type_source":"MenuWorldState via DynamicDialogueAllNode.InitChoiceView","animation_set":"normal","next":"end","speaker_actor_model":"man_wilders_commonvillager_001"},"end":{"id":"end","type":